# Shop Addon Interactions

## Purpose
Integration patterns for shop-related addon interactions in SND macros.

## Scope
This rule covers shop addon interactions, UI manipulation, and shop state management.

## Basic Shop Addon Patterns

### CollectablesShop Addon
```lua
-- Check if CollectablesShop addon is ready
function IsCollectablesShopReady()
    return Addons.GetAddon("CollectablesShop").Ready
end

-- Open CollectablesShop
function OpenCollectablesShop()
    if IsCollectablesShopReady() then
        CallbackAddon("CollectablesShop", "OpenCollectablesShop")
        return true
    end
    return false
end

-- Close CollectablesShop
function CloseCollectablesShop()
    if IsCollectablesShopReady() then
        CallbackAddon("CollectablesShop", "CloseCollectablesShop")
        return true
    end
    return false
end
```

